---
// ExitValueSection.astro
// Placed after ScannerUtilization, before ReferralWorkflow
---

<section class="py-20 bg-[#EEF3FB]" id="exit-value">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#003087]/10 text-[#003087] px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-6"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path
            d="M2 11a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5a1 1 0 01-1 1H3a1 1 0 01-1-1v-5zm6-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v9a1 1 0 01-1 1H9a1 1 0 01-1-1V7zm6-3a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v12a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2a1 1 0 01-1-1V4z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        Exit Value Intelligence
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#003087] mb-4">
        What USRad Can Do to Your Center's Exit Value
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Most referral partners help your monthly P&L. The right ones can change
        what your center is worth when you sell.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Body Copy -->
    <div
      class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-delay="100"
    >
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        When an investor evaluates an imaging center for acquisition, they look
        at two things — EBITDA and payor mix. A standard payor mix commands a
        multiple of 5–7x EBITDA. That's what most centers are worth today.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Here's what can change that number.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Investors value predictability. A center with a diversified payor mix —
        including structured, managed cash-pay volume — looks meaningfully
        different to an acquirer than one dependent entirely on insurance
        reimbursement. That cash-pay volume is contracted, consistent, and not
        subject to insurance renegotiation risk.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        The degree to which this affects your multiple depends on how
        significant that cash-pay component becomes. A handful of referrals per
        week moves the needle modestly. A managed program representing <strong
          >10–15% or more of your overall volume</strong
        > — the kind USRad is designed to generate — can materially strengthen your
        payor mix story and support a higher valuation multiple at exit.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Illustration Label -->
    <div class="text-center mb-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#cc9933] uppercase tracking-wider">
        Illustrative Example — $1M EBITDA Center
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">
        $1M used for clarity of illustration. Actual impact varies by center.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
        <!-- Table Header -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 bg-[#003087] text-white">
          <div class="p-5 font-semibold text-sm"></div>
          <div
            class="p-5 font-semibold text-sm text-center border-l border-white/20"
          >
            Standard Payor Mix
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-5 font-semibold text-sm text-center border-l border-white/20 bg-[#cc9933]/20"
          >
            With Meaningful<br />Cash-Pay Component
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Row 1: EBITDA Multiple -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 border-b border-gray-100">
          <div class="p-5 bg-gray-50 font-semibold text-[#003087] text-sm">
            EBITDA Multiple Range
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 text-center text-gray-600 border-l border-gray-100">
            5–7x
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-5 text-center font-bold text-[#003087] border-l border-gray-100 bg-blue-50"
          >
            7–9x
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Row 2: Illustrative Value -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 border-b border-gray-100">
          <div class="p-5 bg-gray-50 font-semibold text-[#003087] text-sm">
            Illustrative Value
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 text-center text-gray-600 border-l border-gray-100">
            $5M–$7M
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-5 text-center font-bold text-[#003087] border-l border-gray-100 bg-blue-50"
          >
            $7M–$9M
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Row 3: Potential Difference -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3">
          <div class="p-5 bg-gray-50 font-semibold text-[#003087] text-sm">
            Potential Difference
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 text-center text-gray-400 border-l border-gray-100">
            —
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 text-center border-l border-gray-100 bg-blue-50">
            <span
              class="inline-block bg-[#cc9933] text-white text-sm font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
            >
              Up to $2M more
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Table Disclaimer -->
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 text-center mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Actual multiple depends on overall payor mix, market conditions, volume
        concentration, and buyer profile. This illustration assumes USRad
        referrals represent a meaningful share of total scan volume. Not a
        guarantee of valuation outcome.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Closing Statement -->
    <div class="text-center mb-10" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
      <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#003087] italic">
        "That's not a referral relationship.<br />That's a wealth-building
        partnership."
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
      <a
        href="https://app.usrad.com/signup"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#cc9933] hover:bg-[#b8851e] text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-lg transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
      >
        Join the Network
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3">
        $0 to join · No volume commitments · ACR-accredited centers only
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
